<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games.</p>
<p>13 -  Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>12 -  Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>9  -  Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>8  -  Oli Alvarez (Oviedo), Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid),</p>
<p>Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Juan Eduardo Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid)</p>
<p>7  -  Guilherme (Rayo Vallecano), Gustavo Poyet (Zaragoza),</p>
<p>Alfonso Perez (Real Betis).</p>
